tile.infwhat_botania.rune_accelerator.tooltip=Feeds nearby runic altars, triggers the craft when full and shortens the cooldown. Right-click for settings, sneak-right-click to toggle (enable it in the config first).
tile.infwhat_botania.terrasteel_accelerator.tooltip=Feeds nearby Terrestrial Agglomeration Plates. Right-click for settings, sneak-right-click to toggle (enable it in the config first).
tile.infwhat_botania.floral_overclock.tooltip=Runs nearby generating flowers extra ticks; fuel and particles speed up as well. Right-click for settings, sneak-right-click to toggle (enable it in the config first).
tile.infwhat_botania.gaia_beacon.tooltip=Place it near a Gaia arena: once the boss bar is ready it pays 500000 mana and finishes the fight. Right-click is not needed; the beacon only settles a fight that is already running.

